LSTtranslate 第三方声明 / Third-party notices
==============================================

本文件列出 LSTtranslate 使用的第三方数据的来源与许可证。
This file lists the sources and licenses of third-party data used by LSTtranslate.


1. 词典数据包 / Dictionary packs
--------------------------------

“词典”翻译引擎使用的词典包（dict-<src>-<tgt>.tsv.gz）不随程序分发。用户在设置的“模型”页
或首次运行引导中选择下载后，程序从下面的 GitHub Release 获取，存放在数据目录的 models/dict 下：

The dictionary packs (dict-<src>-<tgt>.tsv.gz) used by the Dictionary engine are not distributed
with the program. They are downloaded on request from the GitHub Release below and stored under
models/dict in the data folder:

    https://github.com/willlllliams/thunderbird-translate/releases/tag/dicts-v1

这些包是对下列数据源的改编（抽取、筛选和裁剪），构建规则见
https://github.com/willlllliams/thunderbird-translate 的 docs/dictionary-packs.md。
The packs are adaptations (extracted, filtered and trimmed) of the data sources below.


